---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Book Your Eurovision 2027 Trip | Burgas 2027 Guide" description="Everything you need to book your Eurovision 2027 trip to Burgas in one place — verified accommodation, flights, tours, and travel protection, all vetted by our local team."
  breadcrumb="Book Your Trip"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">Book Your Eurovision 2027 Trip</h1>
    <p class="lead">Everything you need to lock in your Burgas trip, in one place. We only link to services we've personally checked — see our <a href="/disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a> for the full list.</p>

    <div class="glass-panel section">
      <h2 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">🏨 Where to Stay</h2>
      <p>Browse verified apartments, hotels, and villas across Burgas — or jump straight to <a href="/where-to-stay">our full neighborhood-by-neighborhood guide</a> for our hand-picked recommendations in Sea Garden, Lazur, and the Historical Center.</p>
      <a href="https://www.kqzyfj.com/click-101863800-14312907?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.booking.com%2Fsearchresults.html%3Fss%3DBurgas%2C%2BBulgaria" class="btn btn-primary">Search Stays on Booking.com</a>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-panel section">
      <h2 style="color: var(--accent-magenta);">✈️ Flights to Burgas</h2>
      <p>Coming from further afield, or just want to compare fares before you commit? See our <a href="/news/flights-airlines-overview-2027">full flights guide</a> for the honest breakdown of direct, connecting, and budget routes.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="https://www.dpbolvw.net/click-101863800-16943092" class="btn btn-primary">LOT Polish Airlines</a>
        <a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-101863800-12624156" class="btn btn-primary">Compare on Kiwi.com</a>
        <a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-101863800-15347259" class="btn btn-primary">Search on eSky</a>
        <a href="https://www.dpbolvw.net/click-101863800-13957405" class="btn btn-primary">Air Serbia (via Belgrade)</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-panel section">
      <h2 style="color: var(--accent-amber);">🚘 Getting Around</h2>
      <p>For airport meet & greet, private transfers, and group logistics, see our <a href="/transfers">transport guide</a>. Overland bus and train options for reaching Burgas from elsewhere in Europe are in the works — check back soon.</p>
      <a href="/transfers" class="btn btn-secondary">See Transfer Options</a>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-panel section">
      <h2 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">🎟️ Tours &amp; Experiences</h2>
      <p>From Black Sea catamaran cruises to day trips to Nessebar, browse the same excursions international travel platforms are now recommending for Eurovision visitors.</p>
      <a href="https://www.getyourguide.com/burgas-l944/?partner_id=3F441" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Tours on GetYourGuide</a>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-panel section">
      <h2 style="color: var(--accent-magenta);">🛡️ Travel Protection</h2>
      <p>Eurovision week means packed flights and a high chance of delays. If your flight to or from Burgas, Sofia, or Varna is disrupted, you may be owed up to €600 under EU/UK rules.</p>
      <a href="https://www.kqzyfj.com/click-101863800-13668835" class="btn btn-primary">Check Compensation with AirHelp</a>
    </div>

    <p class="disclosure-note">We may earn a commission if you book through the links above, at no extra cost to you — see our <a href="/disclosure">full affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .lead a {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .section {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .section p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .btn-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .disclosure-note {
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
